,"origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"미용실에","meaning":"发廊，美发厅，理发厅","explanation":"미용실：发廊，美发厅，理发厅；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"미용실","audio":"/audio/9f4f9d50afd9fc9a7edb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15431","senseId":"1","lemma":"미용실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미용실에","audio":"/audio/33c20c7dd0ccc81c4e8d.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"파마한","meaning":"烫发","explanation":"파마하다：烫发；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"파마하다","audio":"/audio/030a660109c76d540a1a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82322","senseId":"1","lemma":"파마하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파마한","audio":"/audio/e8842165118e2bd2573b.mp3"}},{"text":"건데,","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건데","audio":"/audio/035d13b9ecf5dca77fd4.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"9f4f9d50afd9fc